<p>A more refined bending stress model used in gear design is given by the AGMA equation, which accounts for geometry and real-world loading effects such as dynamic forces, overload, and misalignment:</p>

<DisplayEquation equation="\\sigma = \\frac{F_t P}{bJ} K_v K_o (0.93 K_m)" title="" />

